<title>JAPAN: OSE TO BRIEF MEDIA ON EXTENDING TRADING HOURS.</title>
<headline>OSE TO BRIEF MEDIA ON EXTENDING TRADING HOURS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Osaka Securities Exchange said on Friday that it would hold a news conference at 1 p.m. (0400 GMT) on extending trading hours.</p>
</text>
